    "subject": "surgery",
    "originalNumber": 231,
    "stem": "9. A 50 y/o patient came to your clinic presenting\nwith dysphagia. Manometric study was done,\nwhich revealed an elevated LES pressure, normal\nLES relaxation, and normal peristalsis in the\nesophageal body. What is your initial diagnosis?",
