    "explanation": "for initial screening, a halo test can be\nperformed. A drop of fluid is allowed to fall on\nan adosrbent surface such as a facial tissue. If\nblood is mixed with CSF, the drop will form a\ndouble ring with a darker center spot\nsurrounded by a light halo of CSF. If it is\nindeterminate, the fluid can be sent for beta\ntransferrin setting which will be only positive if\nCSF is present",
